ExceptionTranslationFilter

Its the core filter which is used to handle the security related exceptions and translate the exceptions into proper http responses or redirecting to the login for page.

It catches exceptions thrown by downstream filters or access checks, such as:

AccessDeniedException (authorization failure)
AuthenticationException (authentication failure)


Then it translates them into:

Redirect to login page (for form-based login)
403 Forbidden (for access denied)
401 Unauthorized (for missing/invalid authentication in REST APIs)
